      ],
      "else": [
        {
          "u_message": "We leave before the next dusk. The water is clean; whoever follows may need the blanket more than we do. The smith Godot repaired our broken blade at his woodland forge. His young helper makes crossbow bolts. We copied the way back here: the old track, the stream crossing, then the charcoal burners’ path. It is a long walk, but there is a master at its end.",
          "type": "info",
          "popup": true
        },
        {
          "run_eocs": "EOC_BERSERK_GODO_LEARN_TRACE"
